WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,787
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,587 --> 00:00:05,324
The owl, the glass and the lamp all call Maya at the same time!

3
00:00:06,124 --> 00:00:08,741
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:09,541 --> 00:00:10,988
This is Episode 52.

5
00:00:11,788 --> 00:00:13,265
Too many alerts at once.

6
00:00:14,065 --> 00:00:15,602
Maya does not know where to look.

7
00:00:16,402 --> 00:00:17,659
Here comes the big board.

8
00:00:18,459 --> 00:00:20,196
Each friend pins a note on the board.

9
00:00:20,996 --> 00:00:22,313
The owl pins a red note.

10
00:00:23,113 --> 00:00:24,690
The glass pins a yellow one.

11
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:27,007
The lamp pins a green one.

12
00:00:27,807 --> 00:00:29,604
Now everything is in one place.

13
00:00:30,404 --> 00:00:31,951
Red means fix this first.

14
00:00:32,751 --> 00:00:34,558
Maya fixes the red one first.

15
00:00:35,358 --> 00:00:36,845
The red note turns green.

16
00:00:37,645 --> 00:00:38,672
Then the yellow one.

17
00:00:39,472 --> 00:00:40,899
Now every note is green.

18
00:00:41,699 --> 00:00:43,236
One board shows everything.

19
00:00:44,036 --> 00:00:46,273
Now you know AWS Security Hub!

20
00:00:47,073 --> 00:00:49,010
Check out the Cloud Town book series.

21
00:00:49,810 --> 00:00:50,737
Link in the bio.

22
00:00:51,537 --> 00:00:52,524
See you next time!

